1
00:00:00,228 --> 00:00:03,258
(Leonard:)Also, we both think
I'm not funny.

2
00:00:03,264 --> 00:00:05,234
(quiet, nervous laugh)

3
00:00:05,233 --> 00:00:08,033
(Leonard:)Huh? See, you're not laughing.

4
00:00:10,238 --> 00:00:12,538
(Skype ringing)

5
00:00:12,540 --> 00:00:14,540
(Mike(on Skype):)Hey, Froot Loops, what's up?

6
00:00:14,542 --> 00:00:17,112
(Howard:)Hey, Mike.

7
00:00:17,111 --> 00:00:19,441
(Howard:)Listen, NASA asked me to

8
00:00:19,447 --> 00:00:22,047
(Howard:)throw out the first pitch
at an Angels game.

9
00:00:22,049 --> 00:00:24,119
(Howard:)You got any advice?

10
00:00:24,118 --> 00:00:25,948
(Mike:)Yeah. Don't do it.

11
00:00:27,555 --> 00:00:29,255
(Mike:)What else you up to?

12
00:00:29,257 --> 00:00:31,287
(Howard:)Why shouldn't I do it?

13
00:00:31,292 --> 00:00:32,762
(Mike:)There's no upside.

14
00:00:32,760 --> 00:00:34,790
(Mike:)If you do well, no one cares.

15
00:00:34,796 --> 00:00:36,326
(Mike:)And if you screw up,

16
00:00:36,330 --> 00:00:39,300
(Mike:)you're an idiot
on YouTube forever.

17
00:00:40,268 --> 00:00:42,338
(Howard:)But it's for a good cause.

18
00:00:42,336 --> 00:00:44,636
(Howard:)What about all the kids
that'll be there?

19
00:00:44,639 --> 00:00:46,269
(Mike:)That's what I'm telling you.

20
00:00:46,274 --> 00:00:47,844
(Mike:)Kids are the worst.

21
00:00:49,443 --> 00:00:53,013
(Mike:)My own daughter tweeted
I have a giant nose.

22
00:00:54,348 --> 00:00:56,318
(Howard:)Well, maybe I'll do a good job.

23
00:00:56,317 --> 00:00:57,417
(Mike:)I don't know.

